Description: terminal text editor with LSP support and TypeScript plugins
 Fresh is a fast terminal-based text editor with mouse support, multiple
 cursors, splits, a command palette, a file explorer, an integrated terminal
 and Language Server Protocol support (completion, diagnostics,
 go-to-definition and more).
 .
 It is extended with plugins written in TypeScript, which run in an embedded
 QuickJS engine. Plugins, including the bundled ones, are compiled with
 esbuild when they are loaded and cached; a package manager installs more
 from git repositories.
 .
 This build uses Debian's QuickJS and esbuild, and leaves out the network
 features (update checks, telemetry, self-update) and the tree-sitter
 grammars for JavaScript, TypeScript and Templ.
